WEBVTT

00:01.680 --> 00:04.210
We have a transfer student joining us today.

00:04.210 --> 00:05.730
Go ahead and introduce yourself.

00:06.450 --> 00:08.230
I'm Asagiri Minori.

00:08.230 --> 00:09.980
Asagiri
Minori

00:08.900 --> 00:09.980
Nice to meet you.

01:30.270 --> 01:35.110
Mob Psycho

01:39.990 --> 01:45.000
Discord
~Choices~

01:45.230 --> 01:47.890
What? Your dad runs a company, Asagiri-san?

01:47.890 --> 01:48.850
That's awesome!

01:48.850 --> 01:49.760
Wanna come over sometime?

01:49.760 --> 01:50.980
Heck yeah!

01:50.980 --> 01:52.670
Let's have a welcoming party.

01:52.860 --> 01:55.550
All right. Whoever's going,
write your name down.

01:56.390 --> 01:58.510
I'm definitely writing my name down!

01:58.510 --> 01:59.910
No need to bother asking Kageyama.

01:59.910 --> 02:01.050
Yeah.

02:03.650 --> 02:06.220
What's his deal? The token punching bag?

02:06.220 --> 02:08.580
Who knows? I've never
really thought about him.

02:08.580 --> 02:10.350
He's barely noticeable.

02:11.860 --> 02:16.320
Hope

02:12.130 --> 02:13.770
Oh, I see...

02:14.560 --> 02:20.110
The people here are accurate representations
of actual people from the real world.

02:20.110 --> 02:24.820
So what you're experiencing is a parallel
world that could've easily come to pass

02:24.820 --> 02:27.410
had your circumstances
been slightly different.

02:27.410 --> 02:31.880
And I'll observe how you fare in this
environment without your powers.

02:32.600 --> 02:34.530
Don't give me that "I don't know" crap!

02:34.530 --> 02:36.550
Are my lessons that boring?

02:36.550 --> 02:37.840
You can stay standing.

02:38.110 --> 02:39.880
All that was left in the
problem was addition.

02:39.880 --> 02:40.710
Talk about lame.

02:40.710 --> 02:41.940
He's too stupid.

02:41.940 --> 02:43.030
Hey, stop that...

02:43.030 --> 02:44.470
He's completely frozen.

02:45.730 --> 02:48.280
You had plenty of relationships in real life,

02:48.280 --> 02:50.760
and you were fortunate enough
to be surrounded by good people.

02:50.760 --> 02:53.400
Situations like that are extremely rare.

02:54.190 --> 02:57.190
You don't have a phone or wallet on you,
and no parents at home?

02:57.430 --> 02:59.650
Don't give me that shit!
How about I give you a nose job?!

02:59.790 --> 03:01.770
Please... let me go...

03:01.770 --> 03:03.410
What? You wanna go?

03:03.410 --> 03:04.610
Bring it!

03:04.220 --> 03:06.980
Get 'im, Sugimoto!

03:04.610 --> 03:06.370
Come on! Come on!

03:07.190 --> 03:08.910
Where the hell are you looking?!

03:15.480 --> 03:18.830
Your extremely talented brother is
no more than a stranger here.

03:18.830 --> 03:23.410
It looks like you refrain from using
your powers in your personal life.

03:23.410 --> 03:25.610
I'm guessing you're trying to
become a better person

03:25.610 --> 03:31.640
by focusing on developing your social skills
rather than your powers,

03:31.910 --> 03:35.570
but only the fortunate in life
would even have that idea.

03:35.570 --> 03:37.780
It shows how lightly you take the real world.

03:38.180 --> 03:40.610
If only I were stronger...

03:40.610 --> 03:41.280
Nature

03:40.610 --> 03:42.030
Dream

03:40.610 --> 03:43.490
Friendship

03:40.610 --> 03:43.490
Darkness

03:41.650 --> 03:43.490
Nature

03:42.160 --> 03:43.490
Here, have some milk!

03:44.070 --> 03:47.370
Wait, didn't you mention you loved milk?

03:47.370 --> 03:49.630
Isn't this what you meant?

03:49.630 --> 03:51.500
Ew, you reek of milk.

03:52.600 --> 03:55.170
One of you better mop that up.

03:56.690 --> 03:59.180
I'm sure that this must
seem inexplicable to you,

03:59.180 --> 04:03.120
but she's bullying you in order
to secure her position in society,

04:03.120 --> 04:05.640
and it's something she's done routinely.

04:06.380 --> 04:09.870
If you don't become stronger,
you'll be used, exploited,

04:09.870 --> 04:12.250
and forever a stepping stone for others.

04:15.750 --> 04:17.020
Not looking good.

04:17.640 --> 04:19.690
Pretty sure Shigeo lost.

04:19.690 --> 04:21.890
But it hasn't even been thirty minutes yet.

04:21.890 --> 04:23.490
That's way too long!

04:23.860 --> 04:25.740
He should've been done in a minute.

04:26.030 --> 04:28.830
If this keeps up,
his sense of self will fall apart.

04:28.830 --> 04:29.700
He's going to die!

04:30.590 --> 04:33.860
Mob is someone who can
solve things on his own.

04:33.860 --> 04:36.790
He actually has strength, unlike me.

04:36.980 --> 04:41.570
Quit being naïve. The next time this
guy wakes up, we're all finished.

04:42.630 --> 04:45.330
Anxiety, fear, rage...

04:45.330 --> 04:48.590
All the negative emotions are
collectively welling up within you.

04:49.420 --> 04:54.200
That's only natural after living in this
world for six months without your powers.

04:55.110 --> 04:58.150
You mustn't misuse your powers.

04:58.150 --> 05:04.820
Calpas

04:58.150 --> 05:04.820
Saga Building

04:59.210 --> 05:01.650
I could see spirits ever since I was born.

05:01.650 --> 05:04.170
I even had the power to exorcise them.

05:05.080 --> 05:07.570
At first, I used my powers for good,

05:07.570 --> 05:10.510
by giving advice and
solving various problems.

05:09.160 --> 05:10.910
The Psychic of the Century
Mogami Keiji-san

05:11.140 --> 05:13.820
But my mother developed a mysterious illness,

05:13.820 --> 05:16.250
and the fees for her treatment were obscene.

05:17.260 --> 05:23.800
Eventually, I started taking underground
jobs to kill people for money.

05:24.390 --> 05:27.720
I even gave up sleep
to earn as much as I could.

05:29.350 --> 05:32.100
But my mother still died.

05:32.100 --> 05:34.580
The cause of her illness
remained unclear to the end.

05:34.580 --> 05:36.440
There was nothing anyone could do.

05:36.440 --> 05:38.400
But then, I found out...

05:39.020 --> 05:41.690
After her death, my mother
became an evil spirit and said...

05:42.400 --> 05:45.650
It's all your fault!

05:46.210 --> 05:49.960
My own actions brought forth evil around me,

05:49.960 --> 05:53.120
and that's what ended up plaguing her.

05:53.540 --> 05:57.580
I should've doubted my way of life,
how I was being used by others.

05:57.580 --> 05:59.540
Suicide by Hanging

05:57.580 --> 06:02.090
Early yesterday, Mogami Keiji-san,
the famous psychic, was discovered dead.

05:57.660 --> 05:59.540
News

05:59.810 --> 06:05.010
I became an evil spirit and decided to
use my powers for myself this time.

06:02.090 --> 06:05.010
According to the MPD, the
cause of death was suicide.

06:05.640 --> 06:07.470
I was going to change the world.

06:07.840 --> 06:13.020
I began to punish those who
brought misfortune to others.

06:13.430 --> 06:15.820
If I dwelt within that girl,

06:15.820 --> 06:19.900
I knew that I could punish these
self-proclaimed psychics as well.

06:20.440 --> 06:24.150
This is how I chose to use my powers.

06:24.790 --> 06:27.680
You are allowed to use your
powers for yourself...

06:27.680 --> 06:29.700
No, you should be using
your powers for yourself.

06:29.700 --> 06:32.100
You understand that now, don't you?

06:35.720 --> 06:36.560
Here you go.

06:40.170 --> 06:42.300
Well, that's a crappy thing to do.

06:42.300 --> 06:46.010
Don't you know that feeding strays
is a public disservice?

06:46.790 --> 06:48.520
What are you going to do about that cat?

06:48.520 --> 06:50.800
N-Nothing...

06:50.980 --> 06:52.820
Really? That poor thing.

06:52.820 --> 06:56.720
In that case, the cat's
probably better off dying.

06:56.720 --> 06:58.560
I'll go take it to a shelter.

06:58.880 --> 07:01.800
Don't... I'll take it in.
I'll take care of it!

07:00.480 --> 07:03.300
Quit scaring Asagiri-san, you punk!

07:09.210 --> 07:11.130
The door broke open!

07:11.130 --> 07:13.070
But it was sealed so tightly...

07:13.480 --> 07:17.600
It worked out because he's not concentrating
as much of his power out here.

07:18.310 --> 07:20.200
Now we can get out.

07:20.200 --> 07:20.910
Call an ambulance!

07:20.910 --> 07:21.830
Carry out the wounded!

07:22.150 --> 07:23.840
You're not going to run away?

07:23.840 --> 07:26.450
Shigeo's done for.

07:26.450 --> 07:27.550
Why are you staying behind?

07:27.750 --> 07:29.380
Because I trust in him.

07:29.570 --> 07:33.090
In this situation?
Are you really this stupid?

07:33.320 --> 07:35.850
Yup, I am.

07:35.850 --> 07:39.560
This is probably the first time someone's
placed so much trust in you too, right?

07:41.150 --> 07:45.380
Mob trusts us... because he's stupid.

07:45.380 --> 07:47.240
I've still got plenty of use for him,

07:47.240 --> 07:50.820
and considering that,
running away is the last thing I want to do.

07:54.840 --> 07:58.580
Well, I can't bring out
Shigeo's latent powers on my own.

07:58.580 --> 08:03.160
In that case, it'd be more effective
to manipulate him from the shadows.

08:04.040 --> 08:06.960
I changed my mind. I'll stay behind as well.

08:07.220 --> 08:08.920
Good. Let's wait this out.

08:09.430 --> 08:12.380
Nope. Waiting's not going
to bring Shigeo back.

08:12.860 --> 08:15.390
I guess I'll have to take
care of this myself.

08:17.470 --> 08:19.930
Are you frustrated? Enraged?

08:20.310 --> 08:22.890
Do you hate them? Do you despise them?

08:23.210 --> 08:25.680
They are a cancer to society.

08:25.680 --> 08:28.940
Stop letting them use you.

08:28.940 --> 08:32.420
You will be reborn as my sympathizer.

08:32.420 --> 08:34.340
I shall give you strength...

08:34.340 --> 08:39.120
Make your negative emotions explode
and use them against the world!

08:45.990 --> 08:50.120
I'm having a hard time getting in...
Shigeo actually got through this shield?

08:50.120 --> 08:50.710
Damn it!

08:55.700 --> 08:58.250
Hey, I can feel my spiritual power spiking.

08:58.250 --> 08:59.600
This should work!

09:01.470 --> 09:03.420
Did it work?

09:03.420 --> 09:04.910
You owe me one.

09:04.910 --> 09:07.860
Now that I've helped you,
you'd better win this.

09:08.280 --> 09:10.600
Wh-What's with you?

09:11.720 --> 09:16.270
I-I can have Papa's bodyguards beat
the crap out of you anytime I want!

09:17.310 --> 09:18.580
So what?

09:21.330 --> 09:22.390
Apologize.

09:23.430 --> 09:25.080
Yes... Make her disappear!

09:25.650 --> 09:26.750
Apologize.

09:27.830 --> 09:33.210
I-I'm sorry...

09:33.990 --> 09:35.970
If you ever bother me again...

09:35.970 --> 09:37.430
Die, you freak!

09:42.770 --> 09:45.020
You should just die.

09:47.350 --> 09:50.480
What did I ever do to you people?

09:50.480 --> 09:52.840
I can't think of a single thing...

09:52.840 --> 09:54.490
But it doesn't matter.

09:55.520 --> 09:57.240
None of this matters.

09:58.670 --> 10:02.410
It's complete. You finally changed.

10:02.910 --> 10:05.300
You were a lot like me,

10:05.300 --> 10:09.350
and that's why I didn't want you
to travel the same path I did.

10:10.820 --> 10:11.880
Hey.

10:11.880 --> 10:13.340
The snot's talking?!

10:13.340 --> 10:16.300
No trespassing
Seasoning Realty

10:13.720 --> 10:16.300
Man, you're pretty far gone, aren't you?

10:16.690 --> 10:18.510
Hey, do you know who I am?

10:19.000 --> 10:20.500
What the heck is this creature?

10:20.500 --> 10:22.730
Actually, before that...

10:22.730 --> 10:23.430
There he is.

10:24.470 --> 10:25.750
Quit lurking.

10:27.340 --> 10:29.770
Damn you for actually falling
for these illusions.

10:30.400 --> 10:31.230
Fine.

10:31.700 --> 10:34.690
I'll have to use all the spiritual power
I've stocked up, but...

10:34.850 --> 10:36.030
Time for some shock therapy!

10:40.820 --> 10:42.830
Remember, Shigeo.

10:42.830 --> 10:45.350
Reigen and I are waiting for you outside!

10:45.350 --> 10:48.330
Rei... gen? Who's that?

10:52.580 --> 10:55.800
Oh, hey, Mob. Sorry, but could
you hurry to the office?

10:55.800 --> 10:57.760
A huge job just came in.

10:57.760 --> 11:00.030
Your master needs your help,
so you better hurry it up.

11:00.620 --> 11:02.470
Mas... ter?

11:02.650 --> 11:05.890
Stop using your powers for
dumb things in this dumb world.

11:06.020 --> 11:09.090
Don't you want to be a big brother
your little brother can look up to?

11:09.090 --> 11:11.780
My little brother? Look up to me?

11:13.560 --> 11:16.650
I accidentally wore the wrong
shoes. These are Ritsu's.

11:17.110 --> 11:19.700
Don't let Mogami influence you like that.

11:19.700 --> 11:23.090
You even managed to stick to your values
when you fought Hanazawa!

11:23.410 --> 11:24.820
That's right...

11:24.820 --> 11:27.620
I'm not supposed to use these
powers against other people.

11:28.030 --> 11:31.080
Not to mention, why are you
losing so easily to commoners?

11:31.360 --> 11:33.550
You bring shame to the Body Improvement Club!

11:33.550 --> 11:36.800
Where did all those muscles you built up go?

11:36.800 --> 11:40.530
I don't know how much time
you've spent in this dump,

11:40.860 --> 11:42.130
but this isn't like you.

11:42.640 --> 11:45.390
Do you want your beloved
Tsubomi-chan to hate you?

11:50.690 --> 11:51.980
Well done.

11:52.350 --> 11:53.080
Nii-san.

11:53.080 --> 11:53.940
Heya.

11:53.940 --> 11:55.600
Body improvement!

11:55.600 --> 11:56.900
Fight on!

11:58.810 --> 12:00.780
Okay, that's going way too far...

12:05.090 --> 12:06.320
I remember.

12:07.260 --> 12:09.910
Do you remember me, too?
I'm your partner!

12:10.100 --> 12:11.840
No, not really...

12:11.840 --> 12:13.360
Seriously?

12:13.360 --> 12:14.840
I'm kidding.

12:14.840 --> 12:16.880
Thanks, Dimple.

12:17.620 --> 12:20.340
So what if your memories came back?

12:21.070 --> 12:25.310
The six months you've spent here
are forever etched into your heart.

12:25.730 --> 12:29.310
I know you were hearing
my voice subconsciously.

12:29.540 --> 12:30.730
Mogami...

12:31.230 --> 12:35.850
Just like you said, the world can be
a cruel and messed-up place.

12:36.620 --> 12:38.820
You helped me see it in a new light.

12:38.820 --> 12:41.280
Huh? Don't tell me you...

12:41.500 --> 12:45.740
I'm truly blessed. I need to be
more thankful to everyone around me

12:45.950 --> 12:47.660
once I get back to the real world.

12:48.210 --> 12:50.960
So that's how it's going to be?

12:51.860 --> 12:56.570
And here I thought I'd found
a sympathizer. How disappointing.

12:56.570 --> 12:58.170
One other thing.

12:58.570 --> 13:02.010
People can change through
their interactions with others.

13:02.680 --> 13:05.330
I was able to change because of everyone.

13:05.740 --> 13:09.590
I was able to become a little stronger
than if I had been alone.

13:10.150 --> 13:13.680
If I'm able to change, then everyone
else should be able to as well.

13:14.100 --> 13:17.010
That means no one is worthless.

13:17.010 --> 13:19.060
Don't say another word...

13:19.340 --> 13:21.530
Or you'll have hell to pay.

13:21.770 --> 13:26.080
The Shigeo you fabricated might
succumb to you, but I won't.

13:26.080 --> 13:27.200
I'm not going to run.

13:27.670 --> 13:31.160
I still have that awful Asagiri-san to save.

13:36.460 --> 13:39.960
Mob Psycho

13:39.960 --> 13:43.460
Mob Psycho

13:49.390 --> 13:51.180
A spiritual mutation?

13:51.480 --> 13:54.390
Guess we're gonna have to fight!
You up for this, Shigeo?

13:56.230 --> 13:58.310
Looks like there's nothing to worry about.

13:59.270 --> 14:00.570
Here come more of them!

14:03.740 --> 14:06.290
Every inhabitant of this world is...

14:12.180 --> 14:13.290
Shigeo!

14:24.680 --> 14:25.680
That's...

14:30.770 --> 14:34.180
I'm going to defeat this evil
spirit and go back to reality.

14:34.180 --> 14:36.010
And what good would that do?

14:36.010 --> 14:39.080
The life you lead won't change,
and nor will society's absurdities.

14:39.080 --> 14:42.650
There will be plenty of things
to annoy and trouble you.

14:43.380 --> 14:45.800
The outside world is... scary?

14:47.080 --> 14:52.780
Life is frustrating, devoid of meaning,
and so, so painful.

14:53.460 --> 14:55.160
I can hear them...

14:55.160 --> 14:58.990
The voices of the dead
are speaking to me.

14:58.990 --> 15:00.560
So many screams...

15:01.410 --> 15:03.690
They died feeling like this?

15:04.520 --> 15:06.620
Is this how they felt when they were alive?

15:07.370 --> 15:10.050
It's such a cruel world...

15:10.920 --> 15:13.320
Am I really going to be able to...

15:13.320 --> 15:14.220
...me...

15:14.720 --> 15:15.510
That voice!

15:15.840 --> 15:17.180
Help me...

15:17.720 --> 15:20.270
Oh... That's right.

15:20.910 --> 15:24.070
I came here to save someone.

15:28.090 --> 15:32.160
I always thought these powers
were of no use to anybody,

15:33.160 --> 15:34.710
but I'll use them to save people!

15:36.040 --> 15:39.870
It doesn't matter what you do.
You cannot defeat me!

15:54.570 --> 15:56.640
Shigeo... you did it.

15:56.810 --> 15:57.940
Well, I'll be damned.

16:03.240 --> 16:06.320
You're not the same boy from earlier.

16:06.660 --> 16:09.770
Who are you?

16:10.410 --> 16:13.020
You finally get how freaky he is?

16:13.020 --> 16:17.070
This is Kageyama Shigeo's true form
that he reveals when he's pissed—

16:17.070 --> 16:17.870
Dimple.

16:19.150 --> 16:23.040
It's dangerous, so leave
this to me and stay back.

16:23.260 --> 16:25.000
Actually, yeah, who are you?

16:28.280 --> 16:33.010
Mogami had overlooked something
that lay dormant within Mob.

16:33.010 --> 16:35.370
A person's heart is made up
of two sides of the same coin.

16:35.370 --> 16:38.390
Just as happiness shines
in the shadows of sorrow,

16:38.390 --> 16:41.470
only in the darkest depths of fear

16:41.470 --> 16:42.940
does courage truly shine.

17:08.970 --> 17:14.520
The powerful blast from
Mob's positive emotions at 100%

17:14.520 --> 17:18.020
annihilated the great evil spirit, Mogami.

17:18.970 --> 17:20.810
Or at least, that's how it looked.

17:23.880 --> 17:26.960
Now that they've lost me, their vessel,

17:26.960 --> 17:32.070
all of the evil spirits that I'd taken in
and controlled will all be freed at once.

17:32.600 --> 17:35.970
Not even I can stop them anymore.

17:35.970 --> 17:36.910
Shigeo!

17:36.910 --> 17:38.740
Dimple, go ahead and head back!

17:38.900 --> 17:40.620
I'll be fine!

17:40.620 --> 17:42.750
Y-You sure about that?!

18:02.560 --> 18:04.980
I'm going to save Asagiri-san.

18:04.980 --> 18:07.520
I'm going to completely exorcise
them before I leave.

18:07.980 --> 18:09.480
I'll be back, I promise.

18:09.700 --> 18:11.190
Don't worry.

18:15.260 --> 18:16.720
You trying to eat me, too?

18:16.720 --> 18:19.340
Damn it. Catch me if you can, you bastards!

18:19.340 --> 18:20.400
Bring it!

18:22.450 --> 18:24.870
I'll be waiting for you on the other side!

18:30.020 --> 18:31.310
In this world,

18:32.240 --> 18:35.320
everything I can see is a spirit.

18:39.070 --> 18:41.550
I have to exorcise them all.

18:44.020 --> 18:46.330
No matter how much you struggle,

18:46.330 --> 18:48.890
your path will lead you to
the same place mine did...

18:48.890 --> 18:50.550
To ruin.

19:50.960 --> 19:54.420
I'm going to save her... I...

19:57.490 --> 19:59.270
I can't go out like this!

20:22.110 --> 20:23.810
I see.

20:24.140 --> 20:27.330
Your vessel has been shattered,

20:27.610 --> 20:29.750
and that's what is inside?

20:37.400 --> 20:39.610
I actually thought you might've died.

20:39.610 --> 20:41.170
That took you ages.

20:41.390 --> 20:42.980
Yes, a very long time...

20:43.310 --> 20:45.290
Master, how's Asagiri-san?

20:46.100 --> 20:48.410
Well, if you're awake...

20:51.060 --> 20:51.880
He's still—

20:53.020 --> 20:55.320
You've made your choice.

20:55.320 --> 20:59.480
I'll keep watching from afar to see
if you made the right one.

21:00.280 --> 21:02.950
You're not going anywhere, my pet.

21:03.310 --> 21:06.450
That was an unexpected trophy. Thank you.

21:06.450 --> 21:09.990
Isn't that... I didn't even
realize he was here.

21:09.990 --> 21:13.480
I'll make sure I take
really good care of him.

21:13.480 --> 21:15.690
Farewell. Perhaps we'll see each other again.

21:24.690 --> 21:26.550
Kageyama-kun?

21:26.990 --> 21:27.910
Yeah.

21:27.910 --> 21:30.240
What? You guys know each other?

21:30.240 --> 21:33.540
Nah, she probably just remembers
what happened over there.

21:34.160 --> 21:37.260
Are you really always like that?

21:38.250 --> 21:40.700
Yeah... I am.

21:40.700 --> 21:41.790
I'm sorry.

21:51.760 --> 21:55.900
I'm really... really sorry...

21:56.740 --> 21:59.840
I'm so sorry! I'm so sorry!

22:00.960 --> 22:03.550
It's okay. I understand.

22:03.790 --> 22:04.760
Understand what?

22:05.550 --> 22:07.550
That people can change.

22:07.940 --> 22:11.120
Mogami-san and Asagiri-san
taught me that.

22:11.120 --> 22:13.220
The people around me changed me as well.

22:14.350 --> 22:17.760
Now I know that I might
be able to change others too,

22:19.000 --> 22:21.950
so I'm glad we were able to meet.

22:25.500 --> 22:26.770
Thank you...

22:28.100 --> 22:32.280
So you're saying the one who
saved you is a boy in your grade?

22:32.760 --> 22:34.370
Yeah, why?

22:34.370 --> 22:37.640
There wasn't a middle school student
among the people I hired.

22:37.640 --> 22:38.330
Huh?

22:38.880 --> 22:40.760
He wasn't even asked to be there,

22:40.760 --> 22:44.200
but he managed to exorcise an evil
spirit that no one else could

22:44.200 --> 22:46.050
and left without saying a word.

22:46.400 --> 22:48.070
That's so cool.

22:48.070 --> 22:49.470
I hope I can see him again.

22:50.180 --> 22:54.560
I did a bit of research,
and this caught my eye.

22:54.560 --> 22:57.060
Psycho Helmet Religion

22:55.080 --> 22:57.060
Huh? Isn't that...

22:59.460 --> 23:02.830
Our religious organization is not
going to survive on donations alone.

23:02.830 --> 23:05.410
It's going to be impossible
to build a headquarters.

23:05.410 --> 23:08.200
Not to mention our beloved founder
is still nowhere to be found.

23:06.240 --> 23:07.000
Ow.

23:08.200 --> 23:11.200
Current Balance:

23:09.200 --> 23:11.200
Thank you for your continued business with us.
\h\hThere has been a deposit of 500,000,000 JPY to your account.
\h\h\hThank you
\h\h\h\hCurrent available balance: 500,010,180 JPY

23:11.900 --> 23:15.360
Master, why aren't you
going to claim your reward?

23:15.360 --> 23:17.440
Look how many people got hurt.

23:17.440 --> 23:19.450
I wouldn't exactly call that a success.

23:20.890 --> 23:23.750
You should never accept money
you feel you haven't earned.

23:23.750 --> 23:26.730
If you do, you'll start to
always take the easy way out.

23:26.730 --> 23:28.830
You just don't want to be held responsible.

23:28.830 --> 23:30.260
That's not it, you moron!

23:30.960 --> 23:36.720
Anyway, no good ever comes out
of drowning in wealth or power.

23:37.110 --> 23:40.600
Mogami let his own powers
swallow him up, too.

23:41.220 --> 23:42.560
You know...

23:42.560 --> 23:49.030
You're better off working part-time for me
than becoming famous or powerful.

23:49.650 --> 23:51.950
Oh, give me a friggin' break...

23:55.580 --> 23:58.980
Hey, quit clowning around with your
classmates, Mob! We're busy here.

23:58.980 --> 24:01.060
They're just using you!

24:01.060 --> 24:03.210
Jeez. You never learn, do you?

24:03.450 --> 24:05.750
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 6:

24:05.750 --> 24:06.840
"Poor, Lonely, Whitey."

24:06.840 --> 24:10.210
Poor, Lonely, Whitey

24:07.270 --> 24:09.660
The DVDs? That's an excellent decision!
